Skin / surface geometry
-----------------------
myo_sim does **not** ship a watertight skin mesh.  ``hand/assets/myohand_body.xml``
uses ``class="skin"`` MuJoCo **capsule and ellipsoid** geoms for contact wrapping,
not renderable surface STL.  This backend draws **bone STL meshes only** in bone
colour as an anatomical skeleton reference.

Research-only use
-----------------
MoBL upstream lineage carries non-commercial terms in OpenSim materials.  The
``myohand`` registry entry is **research-only** and not the default production
backend until HRG-HX6 #13763 owner sign-off.

UpstreamDrift does not copy STL assets into src/; the visual backend loads the
pinned submodule at runtime (same pattern as HRG-GS-M8, #13330).

